","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"894":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"一次看全：常用 ABI 怎么调"},"895":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"896":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"897":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"898":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` — 调 TDLib 接口"},"899":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#emit--发自定义事件","content":"`emit` — 发自定义事件"},"900":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#log--打日志","content":"`log` — 打日志"},"901":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#registertool--登记工具","content":"`registerTool` — 登记工具"},"902":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#usemiddleware--挂中间件","content":"`useMiddleware` — 挂中间件"},"903":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#run--启动","content":"`run` — 启动"},"904":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"905":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"发消息：手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"906":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"907":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"JS / TS 插件就是一个目录：`package.json` 写身份，入口文件写逻辑，`fuyubot.ts`（单文件薄 SDK）\n管通信。运行时是 bun，**TS 不需要 `tsc`**。上手三步见\n脚本插件。本页是**方法手册 + 示例**。"},"908":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"本页讲托管路径的 `fuyubot.js` / `fuyubot.ts`（`fuyubot-js-host`），它也支持\n`runAsync` / `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`。`script_plugin!` 内嵌的\n`fuyubot_plugin.js` 有同名 API，见 异步等待。"},"909":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"manifest 长这样（`entry` 不写就默认 `index.ts`）："},"910":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"薄 SDK 把 VTable 那 22 个函数包成了这些（`run()` 之前只能调同步的那几个）："},"911":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                            | 走的 ABI | 干什么             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter?)` | `on`   | 订阅事件：事件来了就调你的函数 |","table":"table-0"},"912":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                    | 走的 ABI | 干什么    |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------ |\n| `off(event, handler)` | `off`  | 退订一个订阅 |","table":"table-0"},"913":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params?, onResponse?)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 调一次 TDLib 接口；给了 `onResponse` 就在响应回来时调（按 `request_id` 配对，不用自己记请求号） |","table":"table-0"},"914":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么           |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| `invokeAsync(method, params?)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 同上，返回 Promise |","table":"table-0"},"915":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                      | 走的 ABI | 干什么                    |\n| ----------------------- | ------ | ---------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload?)` | `emit` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收到） |","table":"table-0"},"916":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                      |\n| ------------------------------ | ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level = \"info\")` | `log`  | 打日志（`debug` / `info` / `warn` / `error`） |","table":"table-0"},"917":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                   | 走的 ABI                    | 干什么                            |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `registerTool(name, description = \"\", inputSchema?)` | `register_tool`（`meta` 版） | 登记工具**元数据**——脚本不能交函数指针，所以没有处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"918":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI             | 干什么                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `callTool(name, input?, onResponse?)` | `call_tool_result` | 调用一个工具，**同步**拿输出（失败是 `{\"error\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"919":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                    | 走的 ABI       | 干什么          |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| `listTools(onTools?)` | `list_tools` | 同步列出全部工具的元数据 |","table":"table-0"},"920":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `tdExecute(request, onResult?)` | `td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的 TDLib 方法（`parseTextEntities` 之类），发消息**不能**走它 |","table":"table-0"},"921":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 走的 ABI           | 干什么                                  |\n| ------------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `useMiddleware(stage, handler)` | `use_middleware` | 挂中间件（`stage` 是 0..5）；不能单独注销，随插件停止一起撤 |","table":"table-0"},"922":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                            | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `waitForUpdate(filter, timeoutMs?, onMatch?)` | `wait_for_update` | 等一条匹配的更新（在宿主侧独立线程里等），超时回调收到 `null` |","table":"table-0"},"923":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 走的 ABI            | 干什么            |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------- |\n| `waitAsync(filter, timeoutMs?)` | `wait_for_update` | 上一条的 Promise 版 |","table":"table-0"},"924":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 走的 ABI        | 干什么                       |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `getService(name, onService?)` | `get_service` | 读一个服务的元数据；不存在时回调收到 `null` |","table":"table-0"},"925":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                             | 走的 ABI        | 干什么         |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------- |\n| `callService(name, method, input?, onResult?)` | `get_service` | 同步调用服务的某个方法 |","table":"table-0"},"926":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法         | 走的 ABI | 干什么                          |\n| ---------- | ------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `config()` | —      | `plugin_start` 传进来的那份配置 JSON |","table":"table-0"},"927":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法               | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                                |\n| ---------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `pluginConfig()` | —      | **同步**读**自己**那一段配置（`[plugin.<插件名>]`）；`run()` 之前也能用 |","table":"table-0"},"928":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                           |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `getConfig(section, key?, onConfig?)` | `get_config` | 读**任意**插件段（异步，回调在 `run()` 之后） |","table":"table-0"},"929":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `setConfig(key, value, onDone?)` | `set_config` | 写**自己**那一段配置（成功后回写 `fuyubot.toml`） |","table":"table-0"},"930":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                                                                                                |\n| --------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `simplifyInvoke(op, onResponse?)` | `simplify_invoke` | 让宿主跑一个 simplify 操作（发消息等结局、超时撤回、Markdown→entities…）；结果经 `response` 通道回投，整条 `simplifyResult` 交 `onResponse`（不传就只发不收） |","table":"table-0"},"931":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                        | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                                                              |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplifyInvokeAsync(op)` | `simplify_invoke` | 上一条的 Promise 版，`resolve` 整条 `simplifyResult`（`{ok, op, result\\|error}`），自己判 `ok` |","table":"table-0"},"932":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI                   | 干什么                                                                                                                       |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplifyInvokeResult(op, onResult?)` | `simplify_invoke_result` | **同步**跑不碰网络的 op（`parse_text_entities` / `rich_from_markdown` / `list_ops`），回调收结果；传异步 op 拿到 `ok:false` / `code:\"async_op\"` |","table":"table-0"},"933":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 走的 ABI | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | ------ | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | —      | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"934":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"三条容易踩的："},"935":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`onResponse` / `onResult` 这类回调**只在 `run()` 之后才有**——宿主得先握手；模块顶层只能调\n`pluginConfig()` 这种同步的。"},"936":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`tdExecute` 只给不碰网络的方法用，拿它发消息会失败。"},"937":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`waitForUpdate` 是在**宿主侧**线程里等的，脚本这边不阻塞；`timeoutMs` 省略表示只检查当前状态。"},"938":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"`fuyubot.toml` 里每个插件有自己的段（见配置文件）。读**自己**那段\n用 `pluginConfig()`——它是**同步**的，宿主在启动脚本时就把这段塞进了 `argv[2]`，所以\n`run()` 之前（模块顶层）就能用："},"939":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"**读别人的段**（`getConfig`）是**异步**的：回执要等 `run()` 之后才有，所以只能在事件/中间件\n回调里用。段或键不存在时回调收到 `null`。"},"940":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"**写自己的段**（`setConfig`）也是异步的，成功后 `onDone(true)`，宿主会**回写\n`fuyubot.toml`**。⚠️ 回写是**全量重写**，你手写的注释会丢。"},"941":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"写失败（越权 / 值不是合法 JSON / 写盘失败）时宿主只发一条 error 日志、**不会**调 `onDone`\n——别把「没收到回调」当成成功。"},"942":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"脚本插件只能写**自己**的段：`setConfig` 没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定归属，\n所以改不到别的插件那一段（会被拒）。这是 ABI 层面的硬约束，不是薄 SDK 的限制。"},"943":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"944":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"945":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"946":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么到你手上"},"947":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 的更新按 @type 分发到具体订阅，没有具体订阅时落到 update 兜底通道；插件自己 emit 的事件直接送给对应订阅者。"},"948":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 更新"},"949":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"按 @type 分发"},"950":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"PreRoute 之后"},"951":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;updateNewMessage&apos;)"},"952":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"具体类型"},"953":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;update&apos;)"},"954":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"兜底通道"},"955":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"emit(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"956":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"957":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"自己 emit 的事件不走 @type 分发，直接送到同名订阅者——所以插件之间的通信不必绕 TDLib。"},"958":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"959":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                |\n| --------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的对象，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"960":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"961":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"962":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{ \"点分路径\": 期望值 }`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"963":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `onResponse` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"964":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"**`_` 就是 `\"@type\"`**：`params` 里嵌的 TDLib 对象都可以把判别字段写成 `_`，\n薄 SDK 会在发往宿主之前**递归**换回 `\"@type\"`——嵌套多深、数组里的对象都算。\n两种写法等价，同时写了两个时以 `\"@type\"` 为准："},"965":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"这一层只在 JS / TS 薄 SDK 里做（宿主不会替你补判别字段），而且只作用于要发给\nTDLib 的东西：`emit` 的自定义负载、`callTool` 的参数不过这一步，那里的 `_`\n就是个普通字段。"},"966":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `onResponse` 被调用。\n不传 `onResponse` 就是「发完不管」。"},"967":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"968":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"969":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#registertool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"970":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#usemiddleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"971":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"972":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"973":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"974":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**按聊天计数**——记住状态："},"975":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> ✅ **JS / TS 薄封装已经支持** `simplifyInvoke` / `simplifyInvokeAsync` /\n> `simplifyInvokeResult`（见上表）——直接调用即可，不必手写下面这些字段。"},"976":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：用 `simplifyInvokeAsync` 发消息——宿主替你把文本解析成 `formattedText`、\n等到「真发出去」那条 `Message`、超时还会先撤回："},"977":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"只想要同步拿结果（不碰网络的 op）就用 `simplifyInvokeResult`，回调里收整条 `simplifyResult`：\n`parse_text_entities` / `rich_from_markdown` / `list_ops`。传需要等 TDLib 应答的异步 op\n会拿到 `ok:false` / `code:\"async_op\"`。"},"978":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"979":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                       |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，里面 `text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-2"},"980":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                                                        |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `tdExecute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2，`textParseModeHTML` = HTML），把返回的 `formattedText` 整个塞进去 |","table":"table-2"},"981":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-2"},"982":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                               |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}`（论坛）；非论坛的评论串才是 `messageTopicThread` |","table":"table-2"},"983":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                             |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；⚠️ callback 按钮的 `data` 是 **base64**（TDLib 里它是 `bytes`） |","table":"table-2"},"984":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                    |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 都在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层字段 |","table":"table-2"},"985":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                                    |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | `onResponse` 只到**临时消息**；要最终那条 `Message` 得再等一条 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-2"},"986":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名拿不准就问 SDK，它读的是真 `td_api.tl`：`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage`。"},"987":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"988":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`bun fuyubot.ts` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"989":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 bun（机器人用 `bun install` 装依赖、`bun` 起脚本）。"},"990":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：JS 侧没有 schema，先判空或 `as any` 再取；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"991":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"page","content":"C 与 C++ 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native"},"992":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"同一份头文件、extern \"C\"、用你自己的工具链编译"},"993":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"七个符号"},"994":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"C"},"995":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"C++"},"996":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调（C / C++ 同一套）"},"997":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编译（你自己的工具链）"},"998":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"999":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"注意"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C 与 C++ 用**同一份头文件** `fuyubot_plugin.h`，差别只有两条：导出符号要不要放进 `extern \"C\"`，\n以及用什么拼 JSON。头文件是**产物**，不是源码——它由 cbindgen 从 Rust 定义生成，\n用 `fuyubot-sdk codegen` 落盘，别手改（改了下次就被覆盖）。"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C / C++ / Go 没有 async 运行时：请求与更新用回调（`on`），工具结果用\n`call_tool_result` 同步拿。可 await 的版本只在 Rust / JS / TS / Python 的脚本 SDK 里，\n见 异步等待。"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"v3 是四件套，v4 又加了三个（都可以不写，但写了才有对应能力）。"},"1004":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 说明                                                           |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 比 `host->version != ABI_VERSION`，存下 VTable，返回 `PluginHandle` |","table":"table-0"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| -------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 订阅/注册；返回 `0` 表示成功 |","table":"table-0"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 清状态；只登记元数据的插件可以不写 |","table":"table-0"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 说明                                                |\n| -------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放本插件 `malloc` 出来的字符串（`plugin_manifest` 返回的那块也走它） |","table":"table-0"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 说明                                                            |\n| ----------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`），宿主在 `init` 之前读 |","table":"table-0"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 说明                                            |\n| --------------------- | ----- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回 `ABI_VERSION`，`fuyubot-sdk check` 用它判断版本 |","table":"table-0"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | ABI 版本不匹配时宿主靠它回收 `init` 分配的状态（那时不能调 `plugin_stop`） |","table":"table-0"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"`PluginHandle` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以 `context` 不能给 `NULL`。\n版本不对就返回全零句柄，宿主会把它当成拒绝加载。"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"`ABI_VERSION` 与 `FUYUBOT_EXPORT` 都来自头文件，不要自己写死。"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"同 C，**唯一的硬差别**是七个导出符号必须在 `extern \"C\"` 里——C++ 会改函数名（mangling），\n宿主按 ABI 定死的名字 `dlsym`，改了就找不到。"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"`C-unwind` 对 C/C++ 而言与普通 C 调用**ABI 一致**，但 C++ 的异常照样能穿过这个边界——\n逃到宿主那边的异常是未定义行为。**在回调内部把异常处理完再返回**。"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"每个函数第一个参数都是 `g_host->host_ctx`。下面把常用的走了一遍："},"1016":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"⚠️ 三条所有权规则（跨界最容易出事的地方）："},"1017":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`td_execute` / `get_config` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` / `list_plugins` 返回的\n`const char *` 是**宿主线程局部缓冲**，下一次宿主调用之前有效——要留就当场 `strdup`，\n**不要 free 它**。"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"反过来，只有 `plugin_manifest` 返回的那块是**你自己 malloc 的**，宿主读完用\n`plugin_free_string` 还给你（所以必须真能 free，别返回静态字符串）。"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`on` 的 `filter_json` 里 `event_type` 键只用来**选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"`/utf-8` 省掉的后果很难看：中文注释被按系统代码页拆坏，编译器报的是「注释提前结束、后面全是语法错误」。"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编完装进插件目录："},"1022":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（见配置文件）。\nC 侧直接调 VTable 上那两个函数："},"1023":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"两点与其它函数一致：**返回值是宿主线程局部缓冲**（读完即弃，别 free）；`set_config`\n**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，所以插件无法伪造写别人的段。"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> C / C++ **不需要** SDK 薄封装——直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` /\n> `simplify_invoke_result`（见下），或者照下面手写 `sendMessage`。"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` 发消息——宿主替你解析文本、等到真发出去、\n超时先撤回；结果经已有的 `\"response\"` 事件回投（带 `request_id`，与你收 TDLib 响应是同一个 `on` 通道）："},"1026":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"`on_update` 里按 `request_id == rid` 配对，就能从那条 `response` 事件里取出 `simplifyResult` JSON\n（和 `td_invoke_simplified` 的响应是同一个 `on` 通道，逻辑完全复用）。"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1028":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                    |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-1"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                              |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `td_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 原样塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                 |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"要 Markdown 就分两步：先 `td_execute` 拿 `parseTextEntities` 的结果（一个 `formattedText`），\n把它的 `text` 与 `entities` 拼进上面的 `input_message_content`。方法名拿不准时用\n`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage` 查真签名。"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"模板里的 JSON 取值是**朴素查找**（`strstr`），不处理转义、不处理同名嵌套键；认真写就引一个 JSON 库。"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"宿主返回的字符串是**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用之前有效——当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**。"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`，手写注释会丢（见上面「读 / 写配置」）。"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"想少拼 JSON，可以只发 `td_invoke_simplified` 需要的参数对象（`@type` 由宿主补），见 调用 TDLib。"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"page","content":"Python 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"薄 SDK 全部方法的用法、事件怎么触发、可抄的例子"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"一次看全：常用 ABI 怎么调"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` — 调 TDLib 接口"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"`emit` — 发自定义事件"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`log` — 打日志"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"`register_tool` — 登记工具"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`use_middleware` — 挂中间件"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"`run` — 启动"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"发消息：手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"Python 插件就是一个目录：`pyproject.toml` 写身份，`main.py` 写逻辑，`fuyubot.py`（单文件薄 SDK）\n管通信。上手三步见 脚本插件。本页是**方法手册 + 示例**。"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"本页的 `fuyubot.py`（`fuyubot-python-host`）和 `script_plugin!` 内嵌的\n`fuyubot_plugin.py` 都支持 `run_async` / `invoke_async` / `wait_async`，\n见 异步等待。"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"manifest 长这样（`entry` 不写就默认 `main.py`）："},"1059":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"薄 SDK 把 VTable 那 22 个函数包成了这些（`run()` 之前只能调同步的那几个）："},"1060":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                | 走的 ABI | 干什么             |\n| --------------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter=None)` | `on`   | 订阅事件：事件来了就调你的函数 |","table":"table-0"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                    | 走的 ABI | 干什么                      |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------------------------ |\n| `off(event, handler)` | `off`  | 退订一个订阅（脚本订阅也能按事件 + 处理器退） |","table":"table-0"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么                                                                |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `invoke(method, params=None, on_response=None)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 调一次 TDLib 接口；给了 `on_response` 就在响应回来时回调（按 `request_id` 配对，你不用记请求号） |","table":"table-0"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                  | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么                                              |\n| ----------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `invoke_async(method, params=None)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 同上，但返回可 `await` 的 future（**只能**在 `run_async` 里用） |","table":"table-0"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 走的 ABI | 干什么                    |\n| --------------------------- | ------ | ---------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload=None)` | `emit` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收到） |","table":"table-0"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                           | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                      |\n| ---------------------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level=\"info\")` | `log`  | 打日志（`debug` / `info` / `warn` / `error`） |","table":"table-0"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 走的 ABI                    | 干什么                            |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `register_tool(name, description=\"\", input_schema=None)` | `register_tool`（`meta` 版） | 登记工具**元数据**——脚本不能交函数指针，所以没有处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 走的 ABI             | 干什么                                  |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `call_tool(name, input=None, on_response=None)` | `call_tool_result` | 调用一个工具，**同步**拿输出（失败是 `{\"error\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 走的 ABI       | 干什么          |\n| --------------------------- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| `list_tools(on_tools=None)` | `list_tools` | 同步列出全部工具的元数据 |","table":"table-0"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                                        |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_execute(request, on_result=None)` | `td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的 TDLib 方法（`parseTextEntities` 之类），发消息**不能**走它 |","table":"table-0"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 走的 ABI           | 干什么                                  |\n| -------------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `use_middleware(stage, handler)` | `use_middleware` | 挂中间件（`stage` 是 0..5）；无法单独注销，随插件停止一起撤 |","table":"table-0"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                     | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                              |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `wait_for_update(filter, timeout_ms=0, on_match=None)` | `wait_for_update` | 阻塞等一条匹配的更新（在宿主侧独立线程里等），超时 `None` |","table":"table-0"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                 | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                    |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `wait_async(filter, timeout_ms=0)` | `wait_for_update` | 上一条的 `await` 版（**只能**在 `run_async` 里用） |","table":"table-0"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                   | 走的 ABI        | 干什么                       |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `get_service(name, on_service=None)` | `get_service` | 读一个服务的元数据；不存在时回调收到 `None` |","table":"table-0"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 走的 ABI        | 干什么         |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------- |\n| `call_service(name, method, input=None, on_result=None)` | `get_service` | 同步调用服务的某个方法 |","table":"table-0"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法         | 走的 ABI | 干什么                          |\n| ---------- | ------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `config()` | —      | `plugin_start` 传进来的那份配置 JSON |","table":"table-0"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                                |\n| ----------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_config()` | —      | **同步**读**自己**那一段配置（`[plugin.<插件名>]`）；`run()` 之前也能用 |","table":"table-0"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                            | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                           |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key=\"\", on_config=None)` | `get_config` | 读**任意**插件段（异步，回调在 `run()` 之后） |","table":"table-0"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `set_config(key, value, on_done=None)` | `set_config` | 写**自己**那一段配置（成功后回写 `fuyubot.toml`） |","table":"table-0"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                      | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                                                                                                 |\n| --------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplify_invoke(op, on_response=None)` | `simplify_invoke` | 让宿主跑一个 simplify 操作（发消息等结局、超时撤回、Markdown→entities…）；结果经 `response` 通道回投，整条 `simplifyResult` 交 `on_response`（不传就只发不收） |","table":"table-0"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                                                                                     |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplify_invoke_async(op)` | `simplify_invoke` | 上一条的 future 版，`resolve` 整条 `simplifyResult`（`{ok, op, result\\|error}`），自己判 `ok`（**只能**在 `run_async` 里用） |","table":"table-0"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                           | 走的 ABI                   | 干什么                                                                                                                       |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplify_invoke_result(op, on_result=None)` | `simplify_invoke_result` | **同步**跑不碰网络的 op（`parse_text_entities` / `rich_from_markdown` / `list_ops`），回调收结果；传异步 op 拿到 `ok:False` / `code:\"async_op\"` |","table":"table-0"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 走的 ABI | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | ------ | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | —      | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                     | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                                  |\n| ---------------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `run_async(main=None)` | —      | 同上，但跑 asyncio 事件循环，`invoke_async` / `wait_async` 要用它 |","table":"table-0"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"三条容易踩的："},"1085":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`on_response` / `on_result` 这类回调**只在 `run()` 之后才有**——宿主得先握手；模块顶层只能调\n`plugin_config()` 这种同步的。"},"1086":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`td_execute` 只给不碰网络的方法用，拿它发消息会失败。"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`wait_for_update` 是在**宿主侧**线程里等的，脚本这边不阻塞；`timeout_ms=0` 表示只检查当前状态。"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"`fuyubot.toml` 里每个插件有自己的段（见配置文件）。读**自己**那段\n用 `plugin_config()`——它是**同步**的，宿主在启动脚本时就把这段塞进了 `argv[2]`，所以\n`run()` 之前（模块顶层）就能用："},"1089":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"**读别人的段**（`get_config`）是**异步**的：回执要等 `run()` 之后才有，所以只能在事件/中间件\n回调里用。段或键不存在时回调收到 `None`。"},"1090":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"**写自己的段**（`set_config`）也是异步的，成功后 `on_done(True)`，宿主会**回写\n`fuyubot.toml`**。⚠️ 回写是**全量重写**，你手写的注释会丢。"},"1091":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"写失败（越权 / 值不是合法 JSON / 写盘失败）时宿主只发一条 error 日志、**不会**调 `on_done`\n——别把「没收到回调」当成成功。"},"1092":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"脚本插件只能写**自己**的段：`set_config` 没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定归属，\n所以改不到别的插件那一段（会被拒）。这是 ABI 层面的硬约束，不是薄 SDK 的限制。"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"1094":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么到你手上"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 的更新按 @type 分发到具体订阅，没有具体订阅时落到 update 兜底通道；插件自己 emit 的事件直接送给对应订阅者。"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 更新"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"按 @type 分发"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"PreRoute 之后"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;updateNewMessage&apos;)"},"1102":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"具体类型"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;update&apos;)"},"1104":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"兜底通道"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"emit(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"1107":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"自己 emit 的事件不走 @type 分发，直接送到同名订阅者——所以插件之间的通信不必绕 TDLib。"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"1109":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                     |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的 `dict`，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"1110":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"1111":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**是两参数函数，不是装饰器**——`@on(...)` 会报错，老老实实 `on(事件, 函数)`。\n同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"1112":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{\"点分路径\": 期望值}`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"1113":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `on_response` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"1114":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `on_response` 被调用。\n不传 `on_response` 就是「发完不管」。"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"1116":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"1121":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"1122":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**看全部流量**——兜底通道记日志："},"1123":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> ✅ Python 薄封装已经支持 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_async` / `simplify_invoke_result`\n> （见上表）——直接调用即可，不必手写下面这些字段。"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：用 `simplify_invoke` 发消息——宿主替你把文本解析成 `formattedText`、\n等到「真发出去」那条 `Message`、超时还会先撤回（结果经 `response` 通道回投）："},"1125":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"只想要同步拿结果（不碰网络的 op）就用 `simplify_invoke_result`，回调里收整条 `simplifyResult`：\n`parse_text_entities` / `rich_from_markdown` / `list_ops`。传需要等 TDLib 应答的异步 op\n会拿到 `ok:False` / `code:\"async_op\"`。"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1127":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                       |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，里面 `text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-2"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                                                         |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `td_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2，`textParseModeHTML` = HTML），把返回的 `formattedText` 整个塞进去 |","table":"table-2"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-2"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                               |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}`（论坛）；非论坛的评论串才是 `messageTopicThread` |","table":"table-2"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                             |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；⚠️ callback 按钮的 `data` 是 **base64**（TDLib 里它是 `bytes`） |","table":"table-2"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                    |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 都在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层字段 |","table":"table-2"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | `on_response` 只到**临时消息**；要最终那条 `Message` 得再等一条 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-2"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名拿不准就问 SDK，它读的是真 `td_api.tl`：`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage`。"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`python fuyubot.py` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 uv（机器人用 `uv sync` 装依赖、`uv run` 起脚本）。"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：先判空再取（`dict.get()`），不同更新类型的字段位置不一样；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"1139":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"page","content":"富消息","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"messageRichMessage：块树排版、按钮行与本地 Markdown 转换"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"三种源"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"发送与编辑"},"1143":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"行内富文本：`richtext`"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"覆盖靠测试钉着"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 的富消息（`messageRichMessage`）是「一页排版」的消息：标题、段落、表格、代码块、\n按钮行……全是一块一块的**页块**（`InputPageBlock`），行内另有独立的富文本（`RichText`）。\nBot API 管它叫 Rich Messages。"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 里**没有** `sendRichMessage` / `editRichMessage`，也没有自带的 md → 块树转换；\n`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `RichMessage` 把这层补齐了：发送 / 编辑就是\n`sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，Markdown 转换在**本地**完成。"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage：三种构建方式，两个出口"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown、服务端 HTML、手拼块树三条路都能产出同一个 RichMessage 类型；它只有两个出口——发送和编辑，各自落到对应的 TDLib 方法。"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_markdown（本地转）"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown / HTML"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"server_markdown / server_html"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"块树"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_blocks（最底层）"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage"},"1157":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"三种方式产出同一个类型，下游只认它"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"send_rich_message"},"1159":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"edit_rich_message"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"sendMessage"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"editMessageText"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"`RichMessage` 内部是 `RichSource` 三选一："},"1165":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                               | 谁解析                              | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_markdown(md)` | **本地**转换器（对齐官方 Rich Markdown 全表） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                                 | 谁解析                                | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_blocks(blocks)` | 你给现成块树（每块一条 `InputPageBlock` JSON） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源        | 构造                                 | 谁解析              | 谁能发   |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| Markdown | `RichMessage::server_markdown(md)` | **服务端**（发前拿不到块树） | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源    | 构造                               | 谁解析     | 谁能发   |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| Html | `RichMessage::server_html(html)` | **服务端** | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"本地转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表\n一类一例全覆盖：标题 / 段落 / 围栏代码（含 `math`）/ 引用与可展开引用 / 拉引 / 页脚 /\n列表与任务项 / 表格 / 分割线 / 公式 / 折叠块 / 拼贴与幻灯片 / 媒体（按扩展名猜类型）/\n地图 / 锚点 / 按钮行 / 思考占位 / 脚注；行内粗斜删码、标记、剧透、上下标、行内公式、\n自定义 emoji、时间、`mailto:` / `tel:` / `tg://user` / 锚点链接，以及那批 HTML 标签\n（`<u>` `<details>` `<tg-collage>` `<tg-button-row>` …）。**不认的一律当普通文本**\n（引用式链接、`<table>` 这类 HTML 块不会报错，只是原样保留）。"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"参数是 `RichMessageParams`——与 `SendMessageParams` **分开的类型**（那边是「文本 + 媒体」\n二选一，混在一起互斥规则没人记得住）：`message` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id`\n（`Option<Topic>`，见Simplify 封装）/ `reply_markup` /\n`clear_draft` / `timeout_ms`。"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"和 `Simplify` 的其它方法一样，**等到结果才返回**（详见调用 TDLib）："},"1172":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                         | 发出的 `@type`   | 等到什么               | 返回                                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::send_rich_message(chat_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `sendMessage` | 响应 + 发送结局（成功 / 失败） | 最终 `Message`（⚠️ **阻塞**，回调里用 `send_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                                     | 发出的 `@type`       | 等到什么 | 返回                                           |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::edit_rich_message(chat_id, message_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `editMessageText` | 响应   | 改完的 `Message`（回调里用 `edit_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"最常用的两条捷径："},"1175":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮在 Markdown 里**没有语法**，一律显式构造：`RichButton::url / callback / user / copy_text`\n（`.style(RichButtonStyle)` 换样式），用 `with_buttons` / `with_button_row` 追加\n`inputPageBlockButtonRow`。"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"`with_buttons` 只对 **Blocks 源**成立——`server_markdown` / `server_html` 的按钮要用\n服务端语法自己写进文本，对它们调 `with_buttons` 会报 `RichSourceNotBlocks`。"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"块里的行内内容是独立的 `RichText`（31 个构造器，没有 offset/length）：\nMarkdown 语法能覆盖 21 个，剩下 10 个（`mention` / `hashtag` / `cashtag` /\n`bankCardNumber` / `tonAddress` / `botCommand` / `icon` / `button` / `diff` / `anchor`）\n没有 md 写法，用 `richtext::*` 拼好塞进块（配合 `with_block`）。"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"`InputPageBlock` 一共 24 个构造器，本地转换器**全都能产出**（`thinking` 只能出现在草稿消息里，\n结构上仍可构造）；`with_block` 也留给「媒体已上传、要传 `inputPhoto` 句柄」这类 md 表达不了的场景。"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"块级语法**一类一例**：`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table`（每块都再走一遍\n`td_api::InputPageBlock` 反序列化）；整段全格式回归闸是内联的 `official_sample_fully_deserializes`。"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"加块 / 删块会让 `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for` 失败——24 个构造器的\n分工表就烤在这条测试里。"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"相关：调用 TDLib（`Simplify` 的其余方法）、插件总览。"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"page","content":"Rust 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"fuyubot-plugin-api 与 define_plugin! 的完整写法"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"依赖"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"最小可用插件"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`Plugin` trait"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调里带状态"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"一次看全：常用 ABI 怎么调"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#用封装层发消息fuyubot-simplify","content":"用封装层发消息：`fuyubot-simplify`"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"编译与安装"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"Rust 插件只依赖一个 crate：`fuyubot-plugin-api`。它把 `fuyubot-abi` 的形状转成用着不疼的样子——\n`HostApi`（已解包、调用路径上没有 `Option` 和 panic 分支）、`HostExt` 便利方法、\ndrop 即退订的 `Subscription`、`ResponseRouter`（可 `await` 的请求/更新等待），以及\n`define_plugin!` 宏。异步写法见 异步等待。"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"那个空的 `[workspace]` 不是多余的：没有它，cargo 会一路往上找父目录的 workspace 声明然后报错。"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"这就是 `fuyubot-sdk init demo --lang rust` 生成的模板："},"1195":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                   | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `init(host) -> Result<Self, String>` | `plugin_init` | 构造状态；返回 `Err` = 加载失败 |","table":"table-0"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                                    | 对应符号           | 说明                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `start(&mut self, config_json) -> Result<(), String>` | `plugin_start` | 宿主已把 VTable、插件目录都准备好；订阅/注册都写在这里 |","table":"table-0"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `stop(&mut self)` | `plugin_stop` | 可选；宏随后把状态收回 `Box` 释放 |","table":"table-0"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`define_plugin!` 还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——和 `C-unwind` 是两层，\n**两层都要**：一层防 panic 逃出 ABI，一层防 panic 把宿主线程带走。"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（详见配置文件）。\n`HostApi` 上两个方法直接读写它："},"1200":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                           | 作用                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key) -> Option<String>` | 读**任意**段。`section` 空串读顶层（`[bot]` 等），`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。返回 JSON 文本，找不到就是 `None` |","table":"table-1"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                                    | 作用                                                                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `set_config(key, value_json) -> Result<(), AbiError>` | 写**自己**的段。**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，写不到别人那段。`key` 空串覆盖整段。成功后写内存并回写 `fuyubot.toml` |","table":"table-1"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`——你手写在文件里的注释、空行会被 `toml`\n序列化丢掉。插件写配置属于程序化修改，这是可接受的取舍；要保注释就别让插件运行时去改，\n把值手工维护进文件。"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调是裸函数指针，没有捕获环境。状态要么放插件字段、经 `user_data` 传进去，要么像\n`examples/rust-echo` 那样把 `Box<HostApi>` 的地址当 `user_data`："},"1204":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`stop` 里用 `Box::from_raw` 收回，只收一次；否则就是内存泄漏（或重复释放）。"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`Subscription` 是 `#[must_use]`：`let _ = host.subscribe_json(…)` 会**立刻退订**。\n一定要存进插件字段。插件卸载时宿主还会整批回滚，但那时插件自己的状态已经漏了。"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`HostApi` 上是 VTable 那 22 个函数的一对一封装，`HostExt` 另外给了几个「不用自己拼 JSON 字符串」\n的便利方法（`subscribe_json` / `invoke_value` / `call_tool_value` / `config_value` /\n`set_config_value` / `wait_for_update_json` / `info|warn|error`）。下面这段把它们用了一遍\n（省掉了 `user_data` 取 `HostApi` 的样板，见上面「回调里带状态」一节）："},"1207":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么    | 用哪个                                                    |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 订阅 / 退订 | `subscribe_json`（返回 `Subscription`，drop 即退订）/ 句柄 `off` |","table":"table-2"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么       | 用哪个                                                             |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发 TDLib 请求 | `invoke_value(method, params)`（或底层 `td_invoke_simplified` 吃字符串） |","table":"table-2"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                      |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 同步执行 | `td_execute`（`parseTextEntities` / `getTextEntities` 这类） |","table":"table-2"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么         | 用哪个                                                            |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等一条更新 / 一条响应 | `wait_for_update_json`（阻塞）或 `ResponseRouter` 的 `await` 版，见异步等待 |","table":"table-2"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                                      |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 工具   | `register_tool` / `register_tool_meta` / `call_tool` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` |","table":"table-2"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                    |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 服务   | `provide_service`（自己作用域）/ `provide_service_shared`（进程级）/ `get_service` |","table":"table-2"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                              |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 配置   | `get_config` / `set_config`（字符串版）、`config_value` / `set_config_value`（`Value` 版） |","table":"table-2"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                              |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 中间件  | `use_middleware(Stage::X as u32, cb, user_data)` |","table":"table-2"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                           |\n| ---- | ----------------------------- |\n| 看别人  | `list_tools` / `list_plugins` |","table":"table-2"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么        | 用哪个                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 跨语言简化入口（v5） | `simplify_invoke(op_json)` / `simplify_invoke_result(op_json)`——和 JS/TS/Python/Go/C 同一条 op 表（见 ABI › simplify 操作表）；要类型安全的封装仍可用上面的 `fuyubot-simplify` crate |","table":"table-2"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#用封装层发消息fuyubot-simplify","content":"上面 ⑦ 那种手写 JSON 能跑，但每个方法都要自己拼嵌套结构、还要自己等「发送结局」。\nRust 插件可以直接用封装层——**只有 Rust 有这个**（它是 crate，不是 ABI）："},"1218":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#用封装层发消息fuyubot-simplify","content":"它只简化**输入**，不改变输出：每个方法仍经 `td_invoke*` 发出，原始更新照旧对插件可见。\n完整 API（发送 / 相册 / 编辑 / 富消息 / 命令解析）见 Simplify 封装。\n⚠️ 在更新回调里**不能**用这些等待版——等更新要靠接收循环那个线程送回来，而回调就跑在它上面；\n回调里请用 `*_then`，见异步等待。"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"`define_plugin!` **一个 crate 只能展开一次**。一个 cdylib 就是一个插件——这不是限制，是设计：\n七个导出符号名由 ABI 定死，展开两次就是重复定义。"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"要发消息、调 TDLib、等响应，见 调用 TDLib；要按字段过滤更新，见\n订阅与事件；契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"page","content":"脚本插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts","content":"一个目录就是一个插件：Python / JS / TS 写逻辑，装上就跑"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#三步上手","content":"三步上手"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"1. 建目录、写两行"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#2-装进机器人","content":"2. 装进机器人"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#3-跑起来","content":"3. 跑起来"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"薄 SDK 能干什么"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"装好之后会发生什么"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"两种形态怎么选"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts","content":"这一页讲**脚本插件**：不编译、不碰 C ABI，用 Python 或 JS / TS 写一个目录，装进机器人就能跑。"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts","content":