page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"前两个返回**请求号**（`RequestId`），不是结果。结果从响应通道回来。"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号把去程与回程对上"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"插件调 td_invoke 拿到请求号，宿主注入字符串 @extra 后发给 TDLib；响应回来时接收循环按 @extra 认出归属，转成数值 request_id，再经 emit_scoped 只发回发起这个请求的插件。"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"去程"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"插件"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"td_invoke → 请求号 N"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"HostRuntime"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"注入 @extra = \"N\""},"1471":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"TDLib"},"1472":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"真的发出去"},"1473":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应回来"},"1475":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"回程"},"1476":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"接收循环 route()"},"1477":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"按 @extra 认出归属"},"1478":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"emit_scoped"},"1479":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"response 通道"},"1480":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"发起的插件"},"1481":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"过滤器 request_id = N"},"1482":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"同一条 @extra 把去程和回程对上；没接 TDLib 时只发合成请求号，永远等不到响应"},"1483":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应负载是 TDLib 原始 JSON，宿主额外挂一个**数值型** `request_id`（来自它注入的字符串 `@extra`，\n别自己设这个字段）。"},"1484":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"要等某条响应：过滤器写 `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}`。`event_type` 键只选通道，\n不参与负载匹配（见 订阅与事件）。"},"1485":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"**没接 TDLib 时**（`--replay` / `--no-tdlib`）请求只留档并返回**合成请求号**（从 `1 << 48` 起），\n链路照样能测通，但永远不会真的到达 TDLib。"},"1486":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"`wait_for_update` **阻塞当前线程**，`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态；\n返回的 `payload_json` 是宿主线程局部缓冲，只在下一次宿主调用前有效——要留就当场拷走。"},"1487":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"⚠️ **TDLib 的方法名 ≠ Telegram Bot API 的方法名**。TDLib 里所有发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n内容类型靠 `input_message_content` 区分；`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation`\n（HTTP Bot API）**在 TDLib 里不存在**。"},"1488":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                          |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation` | `sendMessage` + `input_message_content.@type` = `inputMessagePhoto` / `inputMessageDocument` / `inputMessageLocation` |","table":"table-1"},"1489":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的     | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `message_thread_id` | `topic_id`，类型是 `MessageTopic`——**论坛**群组用 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":N}`，**非论坛**群组的评论串才是 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":N}`（用 `Topic` 就不会选错） |","table":"table-1"},"1490":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的       | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                        |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id` | `reply_to`（`{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":N}`） |","table":"table-1"},"1491":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                            |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `disable_notification` / `protect_content` | `options`（`@type: messageSendOptions`）里 |","table":"table-1"},"1492":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                       |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `caption`    | 在内容类型里（`inputMessageText` / `inputMessagePhoto` …） |","table":"table-1"},"1493":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                             |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `parse_mode`    | 没有这个字段；`formattedText` 只有 `text` + `entities`（要标记先走 `parseTextEntities`） |","table":"table-1"},"1494":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的         | 在 TDLib 里这么写         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `file_id`（`updateFile`） | 在 **`file.id`**，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"1495":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"`sendMessage` 的真签名（来自 `td_api.tl`）："},"1496":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"查方法名最快的办法是问 SDK（它读的是真 `td_api.tl`）："},"1497":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"`Simplify` 只简化**输入**，不改变输出：每个方法都经 `td_invoke*` 发出，原始更新照旧对插件可见。\n参数形状是**一个方法一个结构体 + 短字段名**，调用方不用拼 TDLib 的嵌套 JSON；\n文本格式（Markdown / HTML）**不自己解析**，经同步的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。"},"1498":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"它的**完整 API 参考（按功能范围分组）在 Simplify 封装**；\n想知道为什么这么拼、为什么这么等，看开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的。\n本页只留跟「请求号 + 线程」有关的那两件事——它们是这层最容易被搞错的部分。"},"1499":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**每个方法都等到结果才返回**，不交回请求号。分两类："},"1500":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                               | 等到什么                                                                                                    | 返回值                                   |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 发送类（`send_message` / `send_message_album` / 富消息） | 响应（**还没发出去**的临时消息）+ 它的**发送结局**：`updateMessageSendSucceeded`（里面有最终 `Message`）或 `updateMessageSendFailed` | 最终 `Message`（相册是与 `medias` 同序的 `Vec`） |","table":"table-2"},"1501":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                                        | 等到什么     | 返回值                  |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| 其余（`edit_*` / `delete_message` / `answer_callback_query`） | 只有**响应** | 改完的 `Message` / `()` |","table":"table-2"},"1502":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"两步之间按临时消息的 `old_message_id` 精确对号，同一会话里别人的结局不会串进来；"},"1503":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"相册的 `timeout_ms` 是**整组共用**的一个预算（先等 `Messages` 响应、再等 N 条结局），不是每项各等一次；"},"1504":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**超时先撤回**：到期还没结局，就先 `deleteMessages(revoke = true)` 把那条没发出去的消息撤掉，再返回\n`Timeout`——发出去的撤不回，没发出去的会被取消；"},"1505":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"`@type == \"error\"` 的响应一律变成 `SimplifyError::Tdlib`（例如 `Message is not modified`），\n**封装层不重试**：限流该等多久是调用方的事。"},"1506":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"等更新要靠**接收循环**那个线程送回来，而插件的更新回调就跑在它上面——在那里等待=自己卡自己，\n等到的一定是超时。每个等待版都有一个 `*_then`：把等待挪到另一个线程，结局交给闭包。"},"1507":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"它们返回那个线程的 `JoinHandle`——**插件要在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**，否则动态库卸载之后线程还在跑库里的代码\n（未定义行为）。三个内置插件就是这么写的，可以照抄。"},"1508":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#最小上手","content":"方法名与参数名由 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 拿真 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据\n（`TdApiSchema::compiled()`）逐条校验，离线就能跑。"},"1509":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"便捷方法把等待收进去了：发送类等**响应 + 发送结局**，其余等**响应**\n（`\"response\"` 通道，事件类型 `RESPONSE_EVENT`，只发给发起请求的那个插件）。\n想自己接原始 JSON，底层出口 `wait_response` / `wait_for_update` 仍然公开。"},"1510":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`WaitHandle::payload_json` / `td_execute` 的返回串都是宿主临时的**线程局部缓冲**，\n只在下一次宿主调用之前有效。要拿数据就立刻读，或者用 `*_json` / `wait_response`（它们已经替你拷好了）。"},"1511":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`HostRuntime::td_send` 在**没接 TDLib** 时只留档 + 发合成请求号（从 `1 << 48` 起），`td_execute` 在同样\n情况下返回 `None`——所以本文的每个方法在离线状态下都能被跑通、但不会真的到达 TDLib（Markdown 会退回纯文本）。"},"1512":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#python--js","content":"脚本里的 `invoke` 有第三参数 `on_response`，按 `request_id` 自动配对，脚本不用自己记请求号："},"1513":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"page","content":"调试与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing"},"1514":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"回放验证、静态检查、装进插件目录"},"1515":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"静态检查：`fuyubot-sdk check`"},"1516":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放：不接账号也能验插件"},"1517":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"安装"},"1518":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"装完还是不响？"},"1519":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"插件出问题通常不是「代码写得不对」，而是「没被加载」「加载了但没订阅上」「订阅了但请求拼错」。\n这三步各有对应的工具，全都不需要 Telegram 账号。"},"1520":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                       | 干什么                  | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk check <产物>` | **静态**读导出符号，不 dlopen | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1521":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                          | 干什么                   | 需要账号吗 |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot run --replay <文件>` | 把一批更新灌进管线后退出，不接 TDLib | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1522":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                            | 干什么              | 需要账号吗 |\n| ----------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <路径>` | 复制产物（＋脚本同伴）进插件目录 | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1523":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                    | 干什么                 | 需要账号吗 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot plugin list` | 真的加载一次，看插件名与 ABI 版本 | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"1524":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令            | 干什么     | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot run` | 真登录、真更新 | 是     |","table":"table-0"},"1525":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"**非零退出 = 宿主会拒绝加载**（缺必需的 `plugin_init`，或根本不是动态库），可以进 CI。"},"1526":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"它**不加载、不运行**：走 `object` 解析 PE / ELF / Mach-O 的导出表，不碰 `dlopen`\n（`dlopen` 会在宿主进程里跑插件的初始化代码，那已经算「加载」了）。"},"1527":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"因此它**看不到 ABI 版本**——版本是 `plugin_init` 的**返回值**，不是符号。它只会如实报\n「只能运行时判定」，不编一个看起来可信的结论。"},"1528":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放把文件里的更新（单个对象或对象数组）灌进六阶段管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，\n插件发出的请求只留档不发。输出三样东西："},"1529":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"每条更新的 `UpdateOutcome`："},"1530":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件打的日志（`HostRuntime::log_lines`，上限 256 行）；"},"1531":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件发出去的请求：`#请求号 方法名 参数`。"},"1532":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数              | 说明             |\n| --------------- | -------------- |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 要回放的更新；对象或对象数组 |","table":"table-1"},"1533":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                  | 说明                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖插件目录（默认取 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `plugins.dir`） |","table":"table-1"},"1534":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                   | 说明                                           |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后的静默窗口；不填时脚本插件 2000ms、纯原生插件 150ms（上限 60 秒） |","table":"table-1"},"1535":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"脚本插件在**另一个进程**里跑，反应要经管道回来，还可能捎带网络请求——窗口太短会把最终答复漏掉。"},"1536":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放**故意不接 TDLib**：它要在任何机器上离线可跑，接了就要账号与网络。\n所以回放能证明「插件收到更新后做出了正确判断、发出了正确请求」，**不能**证明真 Telegram 认这些参数。"},"1537":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"传**工程目录**时会把旁边的 `.py` / `.js` / `.ts` / `.pyi` 一起拷；传单个 dll 时看不到脚本在哪，\n**脚本插件请传工程目录**。"},"1538":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"`plugin install <工程目录>` 找产物的顺序是 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}`（两边都有时取**较新**的那个）。最后一档专为 workspace\n成员准备：`cargo build -p <crate>` 的产物默认落在仓库根 `target/`，工程自己那份 `target/` 并不存在，\n靠父链一样能找到——**没有 `--target-dir` 这个参数**，找不着就直接指着产物装。"},"1539":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状                          | 先看                                                              |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `check` 报 `[缺] plugin_init` | crate 是不是 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`；C++ 的七个符号在不在 `extern \"C\"` 里 |","table":"table-2"},"1540":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                      |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 日志里有「跳过 xxx」 | ABI 版本不匹配，或 `dlopen` 失败（缺兄弟 DLL：把依赖放在插件旁边，加载器会先查库自己的目录） |","table":"table-2"},"1541":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                      |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| 加载了但一条事件都没收到 | 订阅句柄是不是被 drop 了（Rust 侧 `let _ =` 会立刻退订） |","table":"table-2"},"1542":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状      | 先看                                                                                                               |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件起不来 | manifest 身份段（`[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"`）与 `entry` 对不对；`run()` 是不是最后一行；`uv` / `bun` 在不在；原生桥库找不找得到（见 脚本插件常见问题） |","table":"table-2"},"1543":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                    |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 请求发出去了但没收到响应 | 回放里本来就不会有响应（请求只留档）；真环境下等的是 `\"response\"` 通道，见 调用 TDLib |","table":"table-2"},"1544":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"要查 TDLib 的方法名与参数名，用 `fuyubot-sdk td-methods --filter <片段>` / `td-method <名字>`；\n契约与所有权规则见 ABI 契约。"},"1545":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"page","content":"工具与中间件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools"},"1546":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"注册工具（元数据 + 处理器）、call_tool / call_tool_result、六阶段洋葱管线"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"注册工具：元数据 + 处理器"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"调用工具：请求号或同步结果"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件：六阶段洋葱"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"工具（tool）是「有名字、有 schema、可被别的插件或宿主调用」的能力；中间件（middleware）\n是流经更新管线时的洋葱式拦截点。两者的注册都记在**当前插件的作用域**下：\n插件卸载（或加载失败）时宿主一次性回滚这批注册。"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"ABI v4 的 `register_tool` 收三个东西：JSON 描述、可选的处理器、处理器要用的 `user_data`。\n处理器是 `C-unwind` 的 `fn(user_data, input_json) -> *const c_char`，返回 JSON 字符串。"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"只登记元数据（不提供执行能力）用 `register_tool_meta(descriptor)`，等价于\n`register_tool(descriptor, None, null)`。`handle` 无效（`id == 0`）表示登记被拒\n（重名、schema 不合法等）。"},"1553":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段     | 类型     | 说明                |\n| ------ | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `name` | string | 全局唯一，建议 `插件名.工具名` |","table":"table-0"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段        | 类型     | 说明                |\n| --------- | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `version` | string | semver，默认 `0.1.0` |","table":"table-0"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段            | 类型     | 说明      |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------- |\n| `description` | string | 给人看的一句话 |","table":"table-0"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段             | 类型          | 说明   |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---- |\n| `input_schema` | JSON Schema | 描述入参 |","table":"table-0"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段              | 类型          | 说明                  |\n| --------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `output_schema` | JSON Schema | `null` / `{}` 表示不校验 |","table":"table-0"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段                     | 类型       | 说明        |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | --------- |\n| `required_permissions` | string[] | 调用前要过的权限门 |","table":"table-0"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ---- | ---------- |\n| `idempotent` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型     | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ------ | ---------- |\n| `timeout_ms` | number | 默认 `30000` |","table":"table-0"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------- |\n| `is_async` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明                     |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------------------- |\n| `callable` | bool | **读出时才有**：本进程里有没有可调处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"两条入口，按需选："},"1564":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                            | 返回          | 用途                |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------- | ----------------- |\n| `call_tool(name, input_json)` | `RequestId` | 只需要“发出去”，或将来接异步工具 |","table":"table-1"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                                   | 返回          | 用途                              |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `call_tool_result(name, input_json)` | 结果 JSON 字符串 | **同步**拿结果（失败是 `{\"error\": \"…\"}`） |","table":"table-1"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`call_tool_result` 的顺序是："},"1567":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"call_tool_result 的五步链路"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步调用工具时，宿主依次做：按名字查表、过权限门、校验入参 schema、跑处理器、校验出参 schema；任一步失败就返回 error 对象。"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步链路：任一步不过就到此为止"},"1570":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"查表"},"1571":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"名字 → 注册项"},"1572":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"权限门"},"1573":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"required_…"},"1574":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"入参校验"},"1575":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"input_schema"},"1576":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"处理器"},"1577":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"C-unwind 回调"},"1578":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"出参校验"},"1579":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"output_schema"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"结果 JSON（线程局部缓冲，读完即弃）"},"1581":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"任一步不过 → {'{\"error\": …}'}"},"1582":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`call_tool`（返回请求号那条）走的是同一张表，只是不等结果——想要结果就用 `call_tool_result`。"},"1583":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`list_tools()` 返回全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**：读完即弃，\n要留就当场拷走，**不要试图释放它**。"},"1584":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"脚本侧（`fuyubot_plugin.*` 内嵌桥）：Python `host.call_tool(name, input, on_response)`、\nJS `host.callTool(name, input, onResponse)` 现在都走同步结果，回调收到 `output`\n（失败是 `{\"error\": …}`）。脚本注册工具仍只有元数据（`registerTool` / `register_tool`），\n没有处理器指针——脚本进程不能把函数指针交回宿主。"},"1585":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"一个中间件自己看到的是**进入段 / 退出段**两截，中间那句 `next.run(ctx)` 就是分界："},"1586":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件的洋葱：进入段、next.run、退出段"},"1587":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"一次 run 会先复制层列表再执行；next.run 之前是进入段，之后是退出段，外层先进后出。不调 next.run 就不往下走。"},"1588":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"run(stage, ctx)：层列表先复制一份再跑，所以中间件里再挂中间件不会自锁"},"1589":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"进入段"},"1590":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之前的代码"},"1591":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run(ctx)"},"1592":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"交给下一层"},"1593":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"退出段"},"1594":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之后的代码"},"1595":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"外层先进后出；回调返回非 0 就中断这一阶段；不调 next.run 就是不往下走"},"1596":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段          | 数值  | 谁跑它       |\n| ----------- | --- | --------- |\n| `PreUpdate` | 0   | 收到更新、还没解析 |","table":"table-2"},"1597":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它             |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `PreRoute` | 1   | 已解析 `@type`，路由前 |","table":"table-2"},"1598":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `InPlugin` | 2   | 分发给监听器之前；**一条更新只跑一遍** |","table":"table-2"},"1599":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它    |\n| -------------- | --- | ------ |\n| `PostResponse` | 3   | 响应发出之后 |","table":"table-2"},"1600":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段            | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ------------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `PreToolCall` | 4   | 工具调用之前（**目前没有生产调用方**） |","table":"table-2"},"1601":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它        |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------- |\n| `PostToolCall` | 5   | 工具调用之后（同上） |","table":"table-2"},"1602":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"数值就是 ABI 里的 `stage` 参数，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应。"},"1603":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"要点："},"1604":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**回调是 `C-unwind` 的** `fn(user_data, stage: u32, payload_json) -> i32`：返回 `0` 继续、**非 0 中断本阶段**。\n中断只影响**本阶段剩下的层**，管线继续走下一阶段（已经改过的负载照样往下传），宿主记一条 warning。"},"1605":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本。\n按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的负载。"},"1606":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"洋葱模型：进入段在「继续往下」之前，退出段在之后。不往下走就是中断。"},"1607":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"Rust 侧注册返回的 `MiddlewareHandle` 也是 `#[must_use]`，drop 即摘除。"},"1608":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"阶段号非法或回调为空会让 `use_middleware` 直接返回无效句柄（不会静默挂个空层）。"},"1609":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"想看订阅与双通道怎么配合，见 订阅与事件；工具调用的格式最终由宿主层决定，\n契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"1610":{"id":"/docs/usage/build","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"page","content":"从源码构建","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build"},"1611":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"开发者路线：自己编 fuyubot 与 fuyubot-sdk"},"1612":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"前置"},"1613":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"构建"},"1614":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"编出来的东西在哪"},"1615":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"发布包是怎么出的"},"1616":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"自检"},"1617":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"普通用户请走 下载与安装——发布包里有可执行文件和 `tdjson`，不用编译。\n这一页是给要改代码、或者平台没有发布包（比如 Intel Mac）的人。"},"1618":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                    |\n| ---- | --------------------- |\n| Rust | 1.99+（`edition 2024`） |","table":"table-0"},"1619":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置      | 要求                               |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Windows | MSVC 工具链（Rust / C / C++ 插件都用它链接） |","table":"table-0"},"1620":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                   |\n| ---- | -------------------- |\n| 构建输入 | 一份 `td_api.tl`（下面说明） |","table":"table-0"},"1621":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置  | 要求                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------- |\n| 运行期 | `tdjson` 动态库（构建期会被拷到可执行文件同级） |","table":"table-0"},"1622":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它——`TDLIB_TD_API_TL`（显式指定，优先级最高）→ **包内 `vendor/<tdlib-version>/td_api.tl`** → 缓存 → 从 GitHub Releases 下载，拿不到就让**构建失败**。包内那份随 crate 一起发布（1.8.69 已带），所以从 crates.io 装下来的下游与 docs.rs **不用联网**；升 `tdlib-version` 时要记得补 `vendor/<新版本>/`。缓存根顺序：`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` → `$CARGO_HOME/fuyubot-tdlib-vendored` → 项目本地 `<工作区>/.tdlib-cache`。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把最后一档指好，在仓库里敲命令不用先 export。"},"1623":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"转换在**编译期**完成，构建日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于构建时用的那份文件（本机三千多条），**不是常量**，别当断言用。"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`tdjson` 是**运行时**动态加载的，编译期不依赖它存在——所以构建成功不代表运行找得到。构建期 `fuyubot-tdlib/build.rs` 会把它（连同那个目录里的兄弟 DLL）拷到可执行文件同级目录，`target/debug/fuyubot.exe` 拷走就能跑。唯一例外是 `cargo install` 装出来的二进制：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放。"},"1625":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                           | 产物                         | 说明  |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------------- | --- |\n| `cargo build -p fuyubot-cli` | `target\\debug\\fuyubot.exe` | 开发用 |","table":"table-1"},"1626":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                  | 产物                           | 说明                  |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `cargo package-bot` | `target\\release\\fuyubot.exe` | 本地打包（tdjson 已在同级目录） |","table":"table-1"},"1627":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令          | 产物  | 说明                    |\n| ----------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `cargo bot` | —   | 一键 `fuyubot run` 当前目录 |","table":"table-1"},"1628":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"别名就这三个，都写在仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml`（只影响本仓，**没有** `package-sdk`）：\n`fuyubot-sdk` 属于 FuyuBot-SDK 那个仓库，\n在那边用 `cargo build -p fuyubot-sdk-cli` 编，它不需要 `tdjson`。"},"1629":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"本文档其余页面里的 `fuyubot` / `fuyubot.exe` 指的就是这些产物；从发布包安装的用户手里就是解压出来的那个。"},"1630":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"`.github/workflows/release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag 上按平台编 `fuyubot`、三个内置插件与 `fuyubot-sdk`，\n**分开**打三份中间包（本体 / 插件 / SDK），`publish` 再把本体 + 内置插件叠成各平台一个 zip：\n解压得到 `<资产名>/`，里面有可执行文件、该平台的 `tdjson`（从 `TDLib-v<版本>` 那个 Release 取）\n和 `plugins/`。SDK 是单独的 `fuyubot-sdk-<系统>-<架构>.zip`。\n名字与 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表同一套口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`），\n加平台时两边一起加。"},"1631":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"真 TDLib 的端到端自检（要本机的 `tdjson`）："},"1632":{"id":"/docs/usage/config","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"page","content":"配置文件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config"},"1633":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"fuyubot.toml 的字段与默认值"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"字段"},"1635":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"插件自己的配置段"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"几条约定"},"1637":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改了配置怎么生效"},"1638":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"`fuyubot run` 读 `fuyubot.toml`，**所有键都有默认值**。缺这个文件时 `run` 会按模板自动生成一份（等价于先跑一次 `fuyubot init`）——`--replay` 是例外，它不会为了回放在你的目录里留配置。"},"1639":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"一个项目目录长这样："},"1640":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键            | 默认值       | 它决定什么                     |\n| ------------ | --------- | ------------------------- |\n| `[bot].name` | `fuyubot` | 显示名（启动那行、`status` 里的「名字」） |","table":"table-0"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                             |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[bot].api_id` | `0` | **旧位置**；`[telegram].api_id` 优先。新配置写进 `[telegram]` |","table":"table-0"},"1642":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                         | 默认值   | 它决定什么                                                         |\n| ------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].account_type` | `bot` | 登录走哪条路：`bot` → Bot Token；`user` → 手机号 / 扫码。**写错报错**，不会静默当 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                   | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| ------------------- | --- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].api_id` | `0` | TDLib api_id（到 my.telegram.org 申请）。不是秘密；`0` = 没配，`run` 会问 |","table":"table-0"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                      |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `[telegram].data_dir` | `data` | TDLib 的数据目录：database 与 files **都**指它。相对项目根 |","table":"table-0"},"1645":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键               | 默认值       | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| --------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].dir` | `plugins` | `run` 从这里加载插件（动态库 + `scripts/` 下的脚本插件）；`--plugin-dir` 覆盖它 |","table":"table-0"},"1646":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                                                        |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].log_level` | `info` | 插件日志的最低级别：error / warn / info / debug / trace。排查插件时调成 `\"debug\"`；**写错级别名会报错** |","table":"table-0"},"1647":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                          |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `[tdlib].path` | 空   | 留空 = 按四级优先级自动找 tdjson；指定时给 tdjson 的**目录**或文件路径 |","table":"table-0"},"1648":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                       | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `[tdlib].log_verbosity` | `1` | TDLib 日志详细度。TDLib 自己的默认更啰嗦（每轮 `td_receive` 的超时都打到 stderr）；负数按 0 处理 |","table":"table-0"},"1649":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                | 默认值 | 它决定什么        |\n| ---------------- | --- | ------------ |\n| `[plugin.<插件名>]` | 无   | 插件自己的配置段（见下） |","table":"table-0"},"1650":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"每个插件在 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下可以有自己的配置，键值任意、可嵌套。插件名是点分的\n（`define_plugin!` / 脚手架里登记的那个名字，如 `fuyubot.manage`），所以在 TOML 里自然写成\n嵌套表——`[plugin.fuyubot.manage]` 就代表插件 `fuyubot.manage` 那段："},"1651":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"插件在**运行时**读它、写它，走的是 ABI 接口（不是 `plugin_start` 的那个 `config_json`）："},"1652":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"**读**：`get_config(section, key)` —— 读任意段（自己的 + 别人的）。`section` 空串读顶层\n（`[bot]` / `[telegram]` 等），`key` 空串读整段，`key` 是点路径（`nested.k`）。"},"1653":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"**写**：`set_config(key, value_json)` —— **只能写自己名下的段**（没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定，插件无法伪造）。成功会写内存并回写 `fuyubot.toml`。"},"1654":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"各语言的写法：Rust 插件、C / C++ 插件、\nPython 插件、JS / TS 插件（每页都有「读 / 写配置」一节），\n函数签名在插件 ABI。脚本插件读**自己**那段还有个同步入口\n（`plugin_config()` / `pluginConfig()`），`run()` 之前就能用。"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"**`set_config` 回写是「全量重写」**：`fuyubot.toml` 里你手写的注释、空白会被 `toml` 序列化丢掉。插件写配置属于程序化修改，这是简单且可预期的一步；要保注释就把插件要写的值也手工维护进文件、别让插件运行时去改。唯一会被保住的是 `[telegram].api_hash`——它不在插件能读到的配置树里，回写时会从磁盘补回来。"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"模板（`fuyubot init` 生成的就是它）："},"1657":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"**凭据的边界**：`api_id` 与 `api_hash` 是**例外**——它们**每次冷启动**都要随 `setTdlibParameters` 发给 TDLib（session 还有效也一样），不记住就得每次手输，所以 `fuyubot run` 交互式问过之后会把它们**明文写回** `[telegram]` 段。这意味着这份文件从此带着你的应用密钥：**别提交进版本库、别整份发给别人**。不想落盘就设 `TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`（环境变量优先，且不会被写回）。Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码仍然**一律不落盘**，只认环境变量或交互输入（连日志也不许出现）。session 由 TDLib 自己落在 `data_dir`，配置里不记任何登录态。"},"1658":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**相对路径相对配置文件所在目录**（也就是项目根）：`plugins`、`data`、日志目录都按它解析。"},"1659":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**自动 init 只认默认文件名**：缺 `fuyubot.toml` 时 `run` 会生成一份；但用 `--config 别的名字` 时不会凭空造，直接报错。"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`status` / `stop` **不替你造配置**：找不到 `fuyubot.toml` 就报「先 `fuyubot init` 建一个」——面对的是已经存在的实例，凭空建一个只会更迷惑。"},"1661":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`--plugin-dir` 覆盖 `[plugins].dir`，`--config` 换配置文件本身。"},"1662":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"想知道**某一行到底生效成了什么**（含默认值）：`fuyubot config` 直接打出来，见 `fuyubot` 命令参考。"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"字段读出来后，运行参数（凭据来源、加载顺序）见 运行与实例管理；`account_type` 之外没有别的自定义登录入口。"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"配置在 `run` 启动时读一次。改完要重启实例："},"1665":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-32","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"`--replay` 不占单实例锁，所以它可以和跑着的实例并存、跑完就退，适合改插件期间反复试。"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-33","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改完先别急着重启：`fuyubot config --config demo\\fuyubot.toml` 会打印生效值，`account_type` 之类写错时当场就能看出来（那一行是 `⚠️` 开头，而 `run` 要走到登录才报）。"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/usage/env","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"page","content":"环境变量","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"每个变量的读取者与作用"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"构建期 vs 运行期"},"1670":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"凭据"},"1671":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"只在自动 init 那一次生效"},"1672":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                | 谁读                                    | 作用                                 |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs`（**构建期**） | 显式指定 `td_api.tl`，优先级最高（完全离线构建就这么干） |","table":"table-0"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                             | 谁读                     | 作用                                                                         |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` | 两个 `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 缓存根：`td_api.tl` 与 vendored 动态库都放这儿。**必须绝对路径**（build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根） |","table":"table-0"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                            | 谁读                  | 作用                                                                        |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_RELEASES_REPO` | `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 覆盖 `[package.metadata.fuyubot] releases-repo`（默认 `CatMoeCircle/Fuyu-Bot`） |","table":"table-0"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                  | 谁读           | 作用                                 |\n| ------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` | 加载器（**运行期**） | tdjson 的目录或文件，查找优先级 1；嫌四级排查麻烦就直接设它 |","table":"table-0"},"1676":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量          | 谁读                      | 作用                                                             |\n| ----------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_ID` | `fuyubot run` / `login` | TDLib api_id（**不是**秘密）。参与凭据解析（`--api-id` 之后、配置之前），也顺手带进自动生成的配置 |","table":"table-0"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量            | 谁读                             | 作用                                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_HASH` | `fuyubot run` / `login` / 集成测试 | api_hash，**凭据**。它优先于配置里已保存的值，且不会被写回 |","table":"table-0"},"1678":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                             | 作用                                    |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| `TG_BOT_TOKEN` | `fuyubot run` / `login` / 集成测试 | bot 账号的 token；有值就不问 Bot Token，后台运行也能登 |","table":"table-0"},"1679":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                               | 作用                                  |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_NAME` | `fuyubot run` / `login` 的自动 init | 自动生成配置时的 `[bot].name`（默认 `fuyubot`） |","table":"table-0"},"1680":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                 | 谁读                 | 作用                                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------ | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` | `fuyubot-sdk init` | **可选**：指向 SDK 仓库里放着 crate 的目录（`crates/`）。设了生成的插件用 `path = …` 对着源码开发；不设就写 crates.io 版本号（`fuyubot-plugin-api = \"0.1.1\"`） |","table":"table-0"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"**`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` 只在构建期读。** 运行期用的是构建时烤进二进制的路径（`cargo:rustc-env` 写进去的 `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_DIR`——那是构建产物，不是让你设的变量）。运行时动态库最终由加载器的四级优先级决定，**不读** `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE`。"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"缓存根是一串候选，顺序即优先级："},"1683":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"前两档写不进去时会退到项目本地那档；**全都写不进去**才退到 `$OUT_DIR`——那个目录每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空，于是下次构建会重新下载（构建脚本会明确警告）。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把项目本地那档指好了。"},"1684":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"**Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码一律不落盘**：不得写进仓库任何文件、`fuyubot.toml`、测试夹具或日志，只允许**环境变量**与**交互式输入**两个来源。`api_id` / `api_hash` 是例外——它们每次冷启动都要发给 TDLib，`run` 问过之后会明文写回 `fuyubot.toml`（见 配置文件），所以那份文件要当密钥看待。"},"1685":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_id` **不是**凭据，写进配置没问题（`[telegram].api_id`）。"},"1686":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_hash` 三个来源，按序：`TG_API_HASH` → 配置里已保存的（`[telegram].api_hash`）→ 交互提问。问出来的会被写回配置，之后就不用再输。"},"1687":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"后台运行没有 stdin：没有 session、也没 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 时会直接失败；首次连 `api_id` / `api_hash` 也问不了，先在前台 `run` 一次（或设好上表那两个环境变量）。"},"1688":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"`FUYUBOT_NAME` 只在 `run` / `login` **自动生成配置**时被读（缺 `fuyubot.toml`，或 `--config` 指向默认文件名而它不存在）。配置已存在就不参与——否则每次跑都会覆盖你手写的名字。"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"`TG_API_ID` 不一样：它除了带进自动生成的配置，还是**每次** `run` / `login` 解析 `api_id` 的一档\n（`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 交互提问）。它只覆盖 `api_id`，不会动 `[bot].name`。"},"1690":{"id":"/docs/usage","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"page","content":"下载与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage"},"1691":{"id":"/docs/usage-0","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"下载对应平台的包，解压就能跑"},"1692":{"id":"/docs/usage-1","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"下载哪个包"},"1693":{"id":"/docs/usage-2","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"解压、验证"},"1694":{"id":"/docs/usage-3","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"起一个 bot 项目"},"1695":{"id":"/docs/usage-4","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"跑起来"},"1696":{"id":"/docs/usage-5","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"不接账号先验一遍"},"1697":{"id":"/docs/usage-6","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"目录布局"},"1698":{"id":"/docs/usage-7","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"下一步"},"1699":{"id":"/docs/usage-8","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"不用装 Rust、不用编译：到 Releases 下对应平台的 zip，\n解压后里面就是可执行文件，**TDLib 动态库已经和它放在同一个目录**（运行时按「可执行文件所在目录」\n自动找到，不用配环境变量、不用单独装 TDLib），内置插件在同级的 `plugins/`。"},"1700":{"id":"/docs/usage-9","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"资产名是 **`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**（例：`fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`）：\n`<版本>` 就是 Release 版本号，带在名字里方便一眼看出下的是哪个；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64（cargo 口径，和 TDLib 自己的资产同序）。"},"1701":{"id":"/docs/usage-10","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                 | 资产                                | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 10/11（x64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"1702":{"id":"/docs/usage-11","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                | 资产                                 | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 11（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"1703":{"id":"/docs/usage-12","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统            | 资产                              | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（x86_64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"1704":{"id":"/docs/usage-13","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统           | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"1705":{"id":"/docs/usage-14","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                   | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                     |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| macOS（Apple Silicon） | `fuyubot-<版本>-macos-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.dylib` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"1706":{"id":"/docs/usage-15","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**解压出来就是本体**：zip 里没有额外的一层目录，建议先建一个空目录再往里解压。"},"1707":{"id":"/docs/usage-16","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"归档一律 `.zip`（Windows 资源管理器双击就能解，Linux / macOS 用 `unzip`）。"},"1708":{"id":"/docs/usage-17","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**上面没有的平台**（Intel Mac 等）暂时没有包，自己编：见 从源码构建。"},"1709":{"id":"/docs/usage-18","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"插件开发 CLI（`fuyubot-sdk`）在**另一个仓库**的 Release 里：\nFuyuBot-SDK 的 `fuyubot-sdk-<系统>-<架构>.zip`，\n它**不需要** `tdjson`。"},"1710":{"id":"/docs/usage-19","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"先建一个空目录再解压（zip 里没有套层目录，直接解到当前目录会把文件摊开）："},"1711":{"id":"/docs/usage-20","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"Linux / macOS："},"1712":{"id":"/docs/usage-21","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"macOS 从网上下载的二进制会被 Gatekeeper 拦住，解一次隔离属性："},"1713":{"id":"/docs/usage-22","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"`--version` 能打印版本号，说明这个可执行文件本身没坏；真正加载 TDLib 是在 `run` 的时候\n（日志里会有一行 `TDLib 1.8.69 命中「可执行文件所在目录」`——版本号是构建时声明的那个）。加载失败按\n常见问题 排查。"},"1714":{"id":"/docs/usage-23","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"`api_id` 到 my.telegram.org 申请，**它不是秘密**，可以直接写进配置；`api_hash` 是凭据，\n但每次启动都要发给 TDLib，所以 `run` 首次问过之后会把明文写回 `fuyubot.toml`（也可以事先设环境变量 `TG_API_HASH`\n让它一次都不问）——那份文件要当密钥看待，别提交进版本库（见 配置文件）。"},"1715":{"id":"/docs/usage-24","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"真账号的最后一环**没有端到端验过**：`run` 会问凭据、驱动授权状态机、`getMe` 打印账户，然后才开分发；\n真库上的登录与 session 复用是在 `fuyubot-tdlib` 的 `-- --ignored` 自检里验的，但「收真更新 → 插件回一条」\n还没有真账号证据。想先确认插件行为，用下面的 `--replay` 或 `--no-login`。"},"1716":{"id":"/docs/usage-25","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"**没有插件也能起**（「插件 0 个」），插件是后装的：拿到编好的 `.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib` 之后"},"1717":{"id":"/docs/usage-26","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"插件怎么编见 插件总览。"},"1718":{"id":"/docs/usage-27","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"回放是**离线**的：把一批更新 JSON 灌进整条管线，请求只留档、不发到 Telegram。先写一条最小的回放文件："},"1719":{"id":"/docs/usage-28","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"退出码 0 表示回放成功。细节（`--replay-wait`、脚本插件要等静默窗口）见 离线回放。"},"1720":{"id":"/docs/usage-29","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"`fuyubot init` 建出来的项目："},"1721":{"id":"/docs/usage-30","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"配置文件\" href=\"/docs/usage/config/\" />"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/usage-31","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"运行与实例管理\" href=\"/docs/usage/run/\" />"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/usage-32","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"离线回放\" href=\"/docs/usage/replay/\" />"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/usage-33","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" />"},"1725":{"id":"/docs/usage-34","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"常见问题\" href=\"/docs/usage/troubleshooting/\" />"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/usage-35","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"从源码构建\" href=\"/docs/usage/build/\" />"},"1727":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"page","content":"离线回放","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"不接账号验证插件"},"1729":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"输出里看什么"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"慢插件与脚本插件：`--replay-wait`"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"插件目录别指 `target\\debug`"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"与实例的关系"},"1733":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"`fuyubot run --replay` 把一批更新的 JSON 灌进整条管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，用来在任何机器上验插件。"},"1734":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"**每条 update 打一行**，`listeners` 是收到它的订阅数。退出码 0 表示回放成功，非零表示插件加载或回放本身失败。"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落                                 | 含义                                   |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `回放 <@type> → UpdateOutcome { … }` | 管线跑完一条更新的结果。`warnings` 非空说明有阶段或回调抱怨过 |","table":"table-0"},"1736":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                                     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `插件打出来的日志：` | 插件 `log` 的原样回显（`Info mybot: init` / `start()` 是插件生命周期） |","table":"table-0"},"1737":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `插件发出去的请求：` | 插件请求的**留档**。回放不连 Telegram，所以请求不会真的发出去 |","table":"table-0"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"回放是离线路径，所以插件发请求只留档、也不会等响应——要验「响应回到插件」用真 TDLib，并准备好账号。"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"回放完不是立刻退出，而是等一个**安静窗口**再看结果（脚本插件的反应是异步的）。窗口的默认值按插件形态自动选："},"1740":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                       | 默认窗口    |\n| -------------------------- | ------- |\n| 有脚本（`.py` / `.js` / `.ts`） | 2000 ms |","table":"table-1"},"1741":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                | 默认窗口   |\n| ------------------- | ------ |\n| 纯原生（Rust / C / C++） | 150 ms |","table":"table-1"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"插件要发慢速网络请求就把它调大："},"1743":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"`--plugin-dir` 要指向「只放你要验的插件」的目录。指 `target\\debug` 会混进所有示例产物：其中 `counter.dll` 是**脚本插件**，脚本不在它旁边，于是 Node 报 `Cannot find module '...\\counter.ts'`，并且**整个回放以非零码中止**。"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"正确做法是 `plugin install` 到一个干净目录，或把 dll + 脚本一起拷进去："},"1745":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"`--replay` **不占单实例锁、不发布状态**：同一个目录可以一边跑着实例、一边回放。它也**不会自动 init**（回放不该因为你试了一次就在当前目录留下 `fuyubot.toml`），没有配置就按默认值跑，也不碰 `.fuyubot/` 里的实例状态。"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放**不接 TDLib**（无论有没有 `tdjson`）：这是硬约定，否则回放就要账号和网络。"},"1747":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"要看运行中的实例、后台跑、优雅停止，见 运行与实例管理。"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放里插件加载失败，多半是 ABI 版本或脚本同伴位置的问题，见 常见问题。"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/usage/run","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"page","content":"运行与实例管理","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run","content":"前台/后台运行、status、stop 与单实例锁"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"一个目录一个实例"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"前台运行"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台运行"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"看状态"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"停掉"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"常见情形"},"1757":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"实例状态放在 `<项目根>/.fuyubot/` 下的三个文件里，**三件事各占一个文件**："},"1758":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/lock` | **只用来独占**（`try_lock`，进程死即释放）。里面不存内容——Windows 的文件锁是强制的，别的进程读不到被锁的字节 |","table":"table-0"},"1759":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件                | 作用                                                                             |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/status` | `key=value`：pid / started / version / plugins / name。**启动完成之后**才发布（拿上锁只说明进程活着） |","table":"table-0"},"1760":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                      |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `.fuyubot/stop` | 停止请求，内容是 PID。`fuyubot stop` 先写它，让实例自己收摊 |","table":"table-0"},"1761":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"第二次 `run`（前台后台都算）会被拒，报错里带上在跑的那个 PID。"},"1762":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"陈旧的 `lock` **不用手工清理**：拿锁时会顺手删掉上一个实例的 `status` / `stop`。"},"1763":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"`--replay` **不占锁、不发布状态**：离线开发路径不该和跑着的实例互斥。"},"1764":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"顺序是固定的：自动 init → 拿单实例锁 → attach TDLib → 问/读凭据 → **加载全部插件** → 发 `setTdlibParameters` 并登录 → `getMe` 打印账户 → 发布状态 → 最后才开分发。插件先于登录加载，是为了不漏掉登录窗口里的更新。"},"1765":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数              | 作用                     |\n| --------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--config <路径>` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml` |","table":"table-1"},"1766":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数                  | 作用         |\n| ------------------- | ---------- |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖配置里的插件目录 |","table":"table-1"},"1767":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                                                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--api-id <ID>` | 覆盖配置里的 `api_id`（**不是**秘密）。优先级：`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 交互提问；`api_hash` 没有对应参数 |","table":"table-1"},"1768":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用                                           |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-login` | 只起框架、不走登录流程（CI / 容器；已有 session 仍会被 TDLib 打开） |","table":"table-1"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用             |\n| ------------ | -------------- |\n| `--no-tdlib` | 不接 TDLib，只加载插件 |","table":"table-1"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数             | 作用    |\n| -------------- | ----- |\n| `--background` | 放到后台跑 |","table":"table-1"},"1771":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数                                       | 作用     |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `--replay <JSON>` / `--replay-wait <MS>` | 见 离线回放 |","table":"table-1"},"1772":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"凭据来源（按序）：`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH` → 配置里已保存的 `[telegram].api_id` / `.api_hash` → 交互式提问。**交互问出来的会被写回配置文件**，下次冷启动不用再输（这两个值每次都要随 `setTdlibParameters` 发出去，session 有效也一样）。Bot Token 仍只认 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 或交互输入、不落盘，详见 环境变量。"},"1773":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"它派生一个没有终端的自己，stdout/stderr 追加进 `<目录>logs\\fuyubot.log`；父进程等子进程**真起来**（`.fuyubot/status` 发布）才返回。"},"1774":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台跑**没有 stdin**。要交互式登录的场合（还没有 session、也没给 `TG_BOT_TOKEN`）会直接失败，并把日志尾巴打出来指路——先用前台 `run` 或 `fuyubot login` 登一次，session 会落在 `data/`。首次连 `api_id` / `api_hash` 也问不了：先在前台跑一次让它写回配置，或设好 `TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`。"},"1775":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"想单独把登录走完而不起框架，用 `fuyubot login`；要退出登录（清掉本地会话）用 `fuyubot logout`。"},"1776":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"`status` 只读 `.fuyubot/`，**不加载插件、不接 TDLib**。三种结果：运行中 / 陈旧（没人在跑，附上次的 pid 与启动时间）/ 没有运行中的实例。还有一种是「有实例在跑、但状态还没发布」，也就是卡在启动里。"},"1777":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"`stop` 的机制：写 `.fuyubot/stop` → 实例每 500 ms 看一次 → 停接收循环 → 卸载插件（跑 `plugin_stop`）→ 停内核 → 放锁；**8 秒不理会才硬杀兜底**。硬杀跑不到插件的 `plugin_stop`，所以别一上来就 `taskkill`。"},"1778":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"**Ctrl-C 仍是硬杀**：捕获它要开 tokio 的 `signal` feature（会带进 `mio` + `signal-hook-registry` + `errno`，依赖白名单没放行）。要优雅退出就用 `fuyubot stop`，别按 Ctrl-C。"},"1779":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                        | 处理                               |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 重复 `run` 报「已经有实例在跑」，带 PID | 先 `status`，再 `stop`；不要手工删 `lock` |","table":"table-2"},"1780":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象           | 处理                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------------- |\n| `status` 说陈旧 | 正常，陈旧状态不用清理，下次 `run` 自己接管 |","table":"table-2"},"1781":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                      | 处理                         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 后台启动后立刻 `status` 报「启动中」 | 状态是在插件加载 + 登录之后才发布的，等一会儿再看 |","table":"table-2"},"1782":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-32","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象       | 处理                            |\n| -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 进程活着但没更新 | 没登录就收不到任何更新；先用 `--replay` 验插件 |","table":"table-2"},"1783":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting"},"1784":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","content":"tdjson 找不到、%TEMP%、乱码、插件加载失败"},"1785":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"找不到 tdjson"},"1786":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"`LNK1104: cannot open file '...\\Temp\\lnk{GUID}.tmp'`"},"1787":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"中文乱码 / 行号错位"},"1788":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"插件加载失败"},"1789":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"回放以非零码中止"},"1790":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"收不到更新 / 进程停不下来"},"1791":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"**构建成功不代表运行找得到**：`fuyubot-tdlib` 在编译期不依赖 tdjson 存在。缺库时 `run` 不会崩，而是打一行然后继续跑（插件照样加载，只是收不到更新）："},"1792":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"四级查找顺序（不要重排）："},"1793":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                   |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` 指向的**文件**或**目录** |","table":"table-0"},"1794":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                 |\n| --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 2   | vendored（构建期烤进去的目录）→ **可执行文件所在目录** |","table":"table-0"},"1795":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                      |\n| --- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | Linux 带版本号的系统库（`libtdjson.so.1.8.69` …） |","table":"table-0"},"1796":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                          |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | 裸库名（`tdjson.dll` / `libtdjson.so`，走 `PATH`） |","table":"table-0"},"1797":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"报错里的 `[1]` … `[4]` 就是这四档的逐条结果，按顺序看就知道断在哪。嫌排查麻烦就直接指定："},"1798":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"加载动态库时会**先查库自己所在的目录**（Windows 上是 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`）。否则 tdjson 的兄弟依赖（libssl / zlib 之类）找不到，报的却是 `ERROR_MOD_NOT_FOUND`（126）——错误信息说「库不在」，实际缺的是它的依赖。所以 tdjson 和它的兄弟 DLL 要放在一起。"},"1799":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"`cargo install` 装出来的二进制是唯一例外：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放到它旁边或设 `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH`。"},"1800":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"这是 **MSVC 链接器写不了 `%TEMP%`**（受限环境 / 沙箱里常见），跟你的代码无关。把临时目录指到可写的位置："},"1801":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"同一坑的另一面：**测试不许依赖 `%TEMP%`**。仓库约定临时目录一律放 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`——MSYS（git bash）会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`（在 Windows 上解析成当前盘根），受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了。换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"1802":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"本机 PowerShell 的默认代码页是 cp936：`Get-Content` 会把 UTF-8 当 **GBK** 解码，中文注释直接毁掉，还会**吞换行**导致行号错位（按行号删代码会删错）。看文件内容用编辑器或 `read` 工具，别用 shell 的文本通道读写源码。"},"1803":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"脚本插件那条链路的 stdio 两侧已经钉成 UTF-8——Windows 上 Python 默认按系统代码页读管道，不钉就会把中文变乱码。这是 SDK 的职责，插件作者不用管。"},"1804":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`run` 遇到加载不了的插件会打一行然后**继续**："},"1805":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`--plugin-dir` 下的东西会被逐个尝试，所以「少加载了一个」不会让整个进程失败——去看这行。"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                | 原因 / 怎么查                             |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `ABI 版本是 N，宿主是 M` | 插件与宿主的 ABI 不匹配：用同一份 SDK 重新编译，别拿旧产物硬跑 |","table":"table-1"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                        | 原因 / 怎么查                                              |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 缺 `plugin_init` / 根本不是动态库 | `fuyubot-sdk check <路径>` **静态**看导出符号；非零退出码 = 宿主一定拒绝加载 |","table":"table-1"},"1808":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                                           | 原因 / 怎么查                                                                                      |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Node 报 `Cannot find module '...\\counter.ts'` | 脚本同伴不在 cdylib 旁边。用 `plugin install` 装（会连 `.py` / `.js` / `.ts` / `.pyi` 一起拷），或把脚本和 dll 拷进同一目录 |","table":"table-1"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象              | 原因 / 怎么查                                        |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `.dll` 加载报找不到依赖 | 插件把兄弟 DLL 放自己旁边是支持的（加载器先查库所在目录），别把它挪走，也别只拷主 dll |","table":"table-1"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"脚本插件还有一条硬约定：`.py` / `.js` / `.ts` 必须和那个 cdylib **同目录**，宿主按「库旁边找脚本」的规则找它。"},"1811":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"多半是插件目录里有你不想要的东西：`--plugin-dir` 指向 `target/debug` 会混进所有示例产物，其中脚本插件的脚本不在旁边，加载失败就把回放整个拉停。把要验的插件装进一个干净目录即可。见 离线回放。"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象         | 处理                             |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 进程跑着但插件没反应 | 没登录就收不到任何更新。要立刻验插件用 `--replay` |","table":"table-2"},"1813":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象            | 处理                                                         |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `stop` 之后进程还在 | `stop` 是写停止请求，实例每 500 ms 看一次；8 秒不理会才硬杀。硬杀跑不到 `plugin_stop` |","table":"table-2"},"1814":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象           | 处理                                                                         |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 终端里按了 Ctrl-C | 那是硬杀，不是优雅退出（捕获信号要开 tokio 的 `signal` feature，依赖白名单没放行）。要优雅就用 `fuyubot stop` |","table":"table-2"},"1815":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"实例状态、锁与 `status` 的三种结果见 运行与实例管理。"}},"count":1815},"sorting":{"language":"multilingual","sortableProperties":["content","page_id","type","url"],"sortablePropertiesWithTypes":{"content":"string","page_id":"string","type":"string","url":"string"},"sorts":{"content":{"docs":{"1":974,"2":1515,"3":224,"4":183,"5":181,"6":164,"7":1632,"8":1274,"9":1625,"10":818,"11":814,"12":815,"13":820,"14":1626,"15":1285,"16":143,"17":182,"18":309,"19":310,"20":1099,"21":1334,"22":1720,"23":1624,"24":964,"25":1775,"26":225,"27":279,"28":246,"29":247,"30":296,"31":185,"32":265,"33"